// Title: Change Winevt Channel Access Permission Via Registry
// ID: 7d9263bd-dc47-4a58-bc92-5474abab390c
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-09-17
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685.001
// Description: Detects tampering with the "ChannelAccess" registry key in order to change access to Windows event channel.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\WINEVT\\Channels\\") AND where(TargetObject IENDSWITH "\\ChannelAccess") AND (where(Details ICONTAINS "(A;;0x1;;;LA)") OR where(Details ICONTAINS "(A;;0x1;;;SY)") OR where(Details ICONTAINS "(A;;0x5;;;BA)"))) AND NOT (((where(Image ISTARTSWITH "C:\\Windows\\WinSxS\\") AND where(Image IENDSWITH "\\TiWorker.exe")) OR (where(Image = "C:\\Windows\\servicing\\TrustedInstaller.exe")))))
